you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551130/extras/3893077c41883c051ee174df8a79d42e.webp?t=1784051394\" width=780 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Physics and inertia matter, and every jump has consequences. When you learn to flow with the ecosystem, you're on your way to mastering the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551130/extras/2330c53ad856dfc7c23168d3e1c8ed2b.webp?t=1784051394\" width=780 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Does that flower work as a springboard? Does this button activate something?  By using the spheres spread across the map, the player can open up new paths and platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551130/extras/18ae3bc34383a03fbf044ff4a045f7d9.poster.avif?t=1784051394\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551130/extras/18ae3bc34383a03fbf044ff4a045f7d9.webm?t=1784051394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551130/extras/18ae3bc34383a03fbf044ff4a045f7d9.mp4?t=1784051394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are small. The world is not. In Micronova, you venture into a microscopic ecosystem where every plant, every creature, and every structure is part of the challenge. In this world, everything reacts, every